text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_0819CD46 {
    "Which switch closes which hole?"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_0819CD66 {
    "After that battle, I’m even more\nconfused!"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_0819CD91 {
    "Can I get you to push all the buttons\nfor me?"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_0819CDBF {
    "Oh! You’re on your second TRICK HOUSE\nchallenge!"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_0819CDF0 {
    "You’re good at battling too?"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_0819CE0D {
    "The TRICK MASTER rigged all the tricks\nin this house all by himself."
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_0819CE52 {
    "I want to make my own GYM one day.\nSo, I’m studying how to set traps."
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_0819CE98 {
    "I didn’t study battling enough!"
}

text Naranja_Route110_TrickHousePuzzle2_Text_0819CEB8 {
    "You’re strong, aren’t you?\nMaybe even enough to be a GYM LEADER!"
}
